<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>TwoGen Market Research Questionnaires</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light; --ink: #20302b; --muted: #586760; --accent: #276653; --line: #d9e1dc; --paper: #fff; --bg: #f3f6f3; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); font: 16px/1.55 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
    main { width: min(900px, calc(100% - 32px)); margin: 36px auto; }
    header, section { background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    h1, h2, h3 { line-height: 1.2; }
    h1 { margin-top: 0; color: var(--accent); }
    h2 { border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line); padding-bottom: 10px; }
    h3 { margin: 28px 0 12px; color: var(--accent); }
    .note, .purpose { color: var(--muted); }
    .question { border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin: 0; padding: 18px 0; }
    .question legend { font-weight: 650; padding: 0 0 8px; }
    .choices { display: grid; gap: 7px; }
    label.choice { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 9px; }
    input[type="checkbox"], input[type="radio"] { margin-top: 5px; accent-color: var(--accent); }
    input[type="text"], input[type="number"] { max-width: 100%; padding: 9px 10px; border: 1px solid #aebbb3; border-radius: 6px; font: inherit; }
    .inline-input { width: min(360px, 100%); }
    .response-line { width: 100%; }
    .matrix { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 8px 0 18px; }
    .matrix th, .matrix td { border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 9px; text-align: center; }
    .matrix th:first-child, .matrix td:first-child { text-align: left; }
    .matrix thead { background: #edf3ef; }
    .matrix input { accent-color: var(--accent); }
    @media (max-width: 620px) {
      header, section { padding: 18px; }
      .matrix { font-size: 13px; }
      .matrix th, .matrix td { padding: 5px 3px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <header>
    <h1>TwoGen Market Research Questionnaires</h1>
    <p>TwoGen is a startup business concept being developed as part of graduate school work at Montana State University. We hope to launch the service within the next year. These questionnaires will help us understand people’s interests and concerns so we can design a practical framework for the TwoGen model.</p>
    <p><strong>Participation is voluntary, every question is optional, and no personal data will be stored.</strong> This page does not submit or save your answers. If you want to keep your responses, save or print this page before closing it.</p>
  </header>

  <section aria-labelledby="homeowner-title">
    <h2 id="homeowner-title">Homeowner Questionnaire</h2>
    <p class="purpose">Purpose: Understand homeowners’ interest, expectations, and concerns about renting a room in their home. Estimated time: 5–7 minutes.</p>
    <form>
      <h3>About your home</h3>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>1. Do you currently own a home?</legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h1" value="yes"> Yes</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h1" value="no"> No</label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>2. Where is your home located?</legend><label>City or ZIP/postal code: <input class="inline-input" type="text" name="h2"></label></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>3. Which best describes your home?</legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h3" value="single-family"> Single-family house</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h3" value="townhouse"> Townhouse</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h3" value="condo-apartment"> Condo or apartment</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h3" value="other"> Other: <input type="text" name="h3-other" aria-label="Other home type"></label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>4. Do you currently have a room you might consider renting out?</legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h4" value="yes"> Yes</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h4" value="no"> No</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h4" value="unsure"> Not sure</label>
      </div></fieldset>

      <h3>Interest in renting a room</h3>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>5. Have you ever rented out a room in your home?</legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h5" value="currently"> Yes, currently</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h5" value="past"> Yes, in the past</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h5" value="no"> No</label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>6. How interested would you be in renting a room in your home in the next 12 months?</legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h6" value="very"> Very interested</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h6" value="somewhat"> Somewhat interested</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h6" value="unsure"> Not sure</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h6" value="not-very"> Not very interested</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h6" value="not-at-all"> Not at all interested</label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>7. What might motivate you to rent out a room? <span class="note">Select all that apply.</span></legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h7" value="extra-income"> Extra income</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h7" value="housing-costs"> Help with housing costs</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h7" value="companionship"> Companionship or having someone around</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h7" value="responsibilities"> Sharing household responsibilities</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h7" value="affordable-housing"> Helping someone find affordable housing</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h7" value="other"> Other: <input type="text" name="h7-other" aria-label="Other motivation"></label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h7" value="nothing"> Nothing would motivate me</label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>8. What kind of renter would you feel most comfortable considering? <span class="note">Select all that apply.</span></legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h8" value="student"> Student</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h8" value="working-adult"> Working adult</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h8" value="older-adult"> Older adult</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h8" value="relocating"> Person relocating to the area</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h8" value="temporary"> Someone seeking temporary housing</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h8" value="no-preference"> No preference</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h8" value="other"> Other: <input type="text" name="h8-other" aria-label="Other renter type"></label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>9. How long would you consider renting a room?</legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h9" value="under-month"> Less than one month</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h9" value="1-3"> 1–3 months</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h9" value="4-6"> 4–6 months</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h9" value="7-12"> 7–12 months</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h9" value="over-year"> More than a year</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h9" value="unsure"> Not sure</label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>10. Would you consider renting a room with any of these features? <span class="note">Select all that apply.</span></legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h10" value="private-bath"> A private bathroom</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h10" value="shared-bath"> A shared bathroom</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h10" value="private-entry"> A private entrance</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h10" value="shared-kitchen"> Shared kitchen access</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h10" value="shared-living"> Shared living space</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h10" value="furnished"> Furnishings</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h10" value="no-preference"> No preference / not sure</label>
      </div></fieldset>

      <h3>Concerns and expectations</h3>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>11. What concerns would you have about renting a room in your home? <span class="note">Select all that apply.</span></legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h11" value="safety"> Personal safety</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h11" value="privacy"> Privacy</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h11" value="screening"> Trusting or screening a renter</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h11" value="damage"> Damage to my home or belongings</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h11" value="lifestyle"> Noise or lifestyle differences</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h11" value="common-areas"> Sharing common areas</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h11" value="pets-smoking-guests"> Pets, smoking, or guests</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h11" value="legal"> Legal, insurance, or tax questions</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h11" value="rent-disputes"> Collecting rent or handling disputes</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h11" value="fit"> Finding a renter who is a good fit</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h11" value="none"> None</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="h11" value="other"> Other: <input type="text" name="h11-other" aria-label="Other concern"></label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>12. How important would each item be when deciding whether to rent to someone?</legend>
        <table class="matrix"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Not important</th><th>A little</th><th>Somewhat</th><th>Very important</th></tr></thead><tbody>
          <tr><td>Identity and reference checks</td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-0" value="not" aria-label="Identity and reference checks: not"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-0" value="little" aria-label="Identity and reference checks: little"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-0" value="somewhat" aria-label="Identity and reference checks: somewhat"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-0" value="very" aria-label="Identity and reference checks: very"></td></tr><tr><td>Clear rental agreement</td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-1" value="not" aria-label="Clear rental agreement: not"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-1" value="little" aria-label="Clear rental agreement: little"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-1" value="somewhat" aria-label="Clear rental agreement: somewhat"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-1" value="very" aria-label="Clear rental agreement: very"></td></tr><tr><td>Reliable rent payments</td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-2" value="not" aria-label="Reliable rent payments: not"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-2" value="little" aria-label="Reliable rent payments: little"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-2" value="somewhat" aria-label="Reliable rent payments: somewhat"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-2" value="very" aria-label="Reliable rent payments: very"></td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility with household routines</td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-3" value="not" aria-label="Compatibility with household routines: not"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-3" value="little" aria-label="Compatibility with household routines: little"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-3" value="somewhat" aria-label="Compatibility with household routines: somewhat"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-3" value="very" aria-label="Compatibility with household routines: very"></td></tr><tr><td>Help resolving issues</td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-4" value="not" aria-label="Help resolving issues: not"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-4" value="little" aria-label="Help resolving issues: little"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-4" value="somewhat" aria-label="Help resolving issues: somewhat"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-4" value="very" aria-label="Help resolving issues: very"></td></tr><tr><td>Ability to set house rules</td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-5" value="not" aria-label="Ability to set house rules: not"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-5" value="little" aria-label="Ability to set house rules: little"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-5" value="somewhat" aria-label="Ability to set house rules: somewhat"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-5" value="very" aria-label="Ability to set house rules: very"></td></tr><tr><td>Flexibility to end the arrangement</td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-6" value="not" aria-label="Flexibility to end the arrangement: not"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-6" value="little" aria-label="Flexibility to end the arrangement: little"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-6" value="somewhat" aria-label="Flexibility to end the arrangement: somewhat"></td><td><input type="radio" name="h12-6" value="very" aria-label="Flexibility to end the arrangement: very"></td></tr>
        </tbody></table>
      </fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>13. What monthly rent would you expect for a room in your home?</legend><label>$ <input type="number" min="0" step="1" name="h13"> per month</label> <label><input type="checkbox" name="h13-unsure"> Not sure</label></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>14. What would make you feel more comfortable renting a room?</legend><input class="response-line" type="text" name="h14"></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>15. What questions would you want answered before deciding?</legend><input class="response-line" type="text" name="h15"></fieldset>

      <h3>About you <span class="note">(optional)</span></h3>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>16. Which age range are you in?</legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h16" value="under-25"> Under 25</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h16" value="25-34"> 25–34</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h16" value="35-44"> 35–44</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h16" value="45-54"> 45–54</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h16" value="55-64"> 55–64</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h16" value="65-plus"> 65 or older</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h16" value="prefer-not"> Prefer not to say</label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>17. How many people currently live in your home, including you?</legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h17" value="1"> 1</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h17" value="2"> 2</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h17" value="3"> 3</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h17" value="4-plus"> 4 or more</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="h17" value="prefer-not"> Prefer not to say</label>
      </div></fieldset>
    </form>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="renter-title">
    <h2 id="renter-title">Renter Questionnaire</h2>
    <p class="purpose">Purpose: Understand prospective renters’ interest, expectations, and concerns about renting a room in someone’s home. Estimated time: 5–7 minutes.</p>
    <form>
      <h3>About your housing needs</h3>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>1. Are you currently looking for a place to live or expecting to move within the next 12 months?</legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r1" value="actively-looking"> Yes, actively looking</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r1" value="may-move"> Yes, may move later</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r1" value="no"> No</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r1" value="unsure"> Not sure</label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>2. Where are you looking to live?</legend><label>City or ZIP/postal code: <input class="inline-input" type="text" name="r2"></label></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>3. When would you want to move?</legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r3" value="asap"> As soon as possible</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r3" value="1-3"> Within 1–3 months</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r3" value="4-6"> Within 4–6 months</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r3" value="over-6"> More than 6 months from now</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r3" value="unsure"> Not sure</label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>4. How long would you ideally rent for?</legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r4" value="under-month"> Less than one month</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r4" value="1-3"> 1–3 months</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r4" value="4-6"> 4–6 months</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r4" value="7-12"> 7–12 months</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r4" value="over-year"> More than a year</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r4" value="flexible"> Flexible / not sure</label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>5. What is your comfortable monthly budget for rent, including utilities?</legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r5" value="under-500"> Under $500</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r5" value="500-749"> $500–$749</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r5" value="750-999"> $750–$999</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r5" value="1000-1249"> $1,000–$1,249</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r5" value="1250-plus"> $1,250 or more</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r5" value="prefer-not"> Prefer not to say</label>
      </div></fieldset>

      <h3>Interest in renting a room</h3>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>6. How interested would you be in renting a room in a homeowner’s home?</legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r6" value="very"> Very interested</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r6" value="somewhat"> Somewhat interested</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r6" value="unsure"> Not sure</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r6" value="not-very"> Not very interested</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r6" value="not-at-all"> Not at all interested</label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>7. What might make renting a room appealing to you? <span class="note">Select all that apply.</span></legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r7" value="lower-rent"> Lower rent than renting a whole apartment or house</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r7" value="utilities-furnishings"> Utilities or furnishings included</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r7" value="flexible-lease"> A flexible lease</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r7" value="location"> A convenient location</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r7" value="quiet"> A quieter or more home-like setting</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r7" value="companionship"> Companionship or shared activities</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r7" value="quick-housing"> Help finding housing quickly</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r7" value="other"> Other: <input type="text" name="r7-other" aria-label="Other appealing factor"></label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r7" value="nothing"> Nothing would make it appealing</label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>8. What room or home features would matter most to you? <span class="note">Select all that apply.</span></legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r8" value="private-bath"> Private bathroom</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r8" value="shared-bath"> Shared bathroom</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r8" value="private-entry"> Private entrance</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r8" value="kitchen"> Kitchen access</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r8" value="laundry"> Laundry access</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r8" value="furnished"> Furnished room</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r8" value="parking"> Parking</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r8" value="pets"> Pet-friendly home</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r8" value="transit"> Transit or walkable location</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r8" value="other"> Other: <input type="text" name="r8-other" aria-label="Other feature"></label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>9. Would you consider sharing common areas with the homeowner?</legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r9" value="yes"> Yes</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r9" value="depends"> Yes, depending on the home and house rules</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r9" value="unsure"> Not sure</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="r9" value="no"> No</label>
      </div></fieldset>

      <h3>Concerns and expectations</h3>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>10. What concerns would you have about renting a room in someone’s home? <span class="note">Select all that apply.</span></legend><div class="choices">
        <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r10" value="safety"> Personal safety</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r10" value="privacy"> Privacy</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r10" value="compatibility"> Compatibility with the homeowner</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r10" value="rules"> House rules or restrictions</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r10" value="access"> Access to kitchen, bathroom, or laundry</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r10" value="guests"> Guests, visitors, or overnight stays</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r10" value="costs"> Rent, deposits, or extra costs</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r10" value="lease"> Lease terms or being asked to leave</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r10" value="fair-treatment"> Fair treatment or resolving disagreements</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r10" value="pets-noise"> Pets, smoking, or noise</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r10" value="none"> None</label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="r10" value="other"> Other: <input type="text" name="r10-other" aria-label="Other concern"></label>
      </div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>11. How important would each item be when choosing a room?</legend>
        <table class="matrix"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Not important</th><th>A little</th><th>Somewhat</th><th>Very important</th></tr></thead><tbody>
          <tr><td>Clear rent and utility costs</td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-0" value="not" aria-label="Clear rent and utility costs: not"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-0" value="little" aria-label="Clear rent and utility costs: little"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-0" value="somewhat" aria-label="Clear rent and utility costs: somewhat"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-0" value="very" aria-label="Clear rent and utility costs: very"></td></tr><tr><td>A written rental agreement</td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-1" value="not" aria-label="A written rental agreement: not"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-1" value="little" aria-label="A written rental agreement: little"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-1" value="somewhat" aria-label="A written rental agreement: somewhat"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-1" value="very" aria-label="A written rental agreement: very"></td></tr><tr><td>A private, secure room</td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-2" value="not" aria-label="A private, secure room: not"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-2" value="little" aria-label="A private, secure room: little"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-2" value="somewhat" aria-label="A private, secure room: somewhat"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-2" value="very" aria-label="A private, secure room: very"></td></tr><tr><td>Clear house rules</td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-3" value="not" aria-label="Clear house rules: not"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-3" value="little" aria-label="Clear house rules: little"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-3" value="somewhat" aria-label="Clear house rules: somewhat"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-3" value="very" aria-label="Clear house rules: very"></td></tr><tr><td>Knowing who else lives in the home</td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-4" value="not" aria-label="Knowing who else lives in the home: not"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-4" value="little" aria-label="Knowing who else lives in the home: little"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-4" value="somewhat" aria-label="Knowing who else lives in the home: somewhat"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-4" value="very" aria-label="Knowing who else lives in the home: very"></td></tr><tr><td>A way to raise concerns or resolve problems</td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-5" value="not" aria-label="A way to raise concerns or resolve problems: not"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-5" value="little" aria-label="A way to raise concerns or resolve problems: little"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-5" value="somewhat" aria-label="A way to raise concerns or resolve problems: somewhat"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-5" value="very" aria-label="A way to raise concerns or resolve problems: very"></td></tr><tr><td>Flexibility in lease length</td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-6" value="not" aria-label="Flexibility in lease length: not"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-6" value="little" aria-label="Flexibility in lease length: little"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-6" value="somewhat" aria-label="Flexibility in lease length: somewhat"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-6" value="very" aria-label="Flexibility in lease length: very"></td></tr><tr><td>Being able to meet the homeowner before committing</td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-7" value="not" aria-label="Being able to meet the homeowner before committing: not"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-7" value="little" aria-label="Being able to meet the homeowner before committing: little"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-7" value="somewhat" aria-label="Being able to meet the homeowner before committing: somewhat"></td><td><input type="radio" name="r11-7" value="very" aria-label="Being able to meet the homeowner before committing: very"></td></tr>
        </tbody></table>
      </fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>12. What would help you feel safe and comfortable before moving in?</legend><input class="response-line" type="text" name="r12"></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>13. What monthly rent would you expect to pay for a room that meets your needs?</legend><label>$ <input type="number" min="0" step="1" name="r13"> per month</label> <label><input type="checkbox" name="r13-unsure"> Not sure</label></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>14. What would make you choose a room in someone’s home over another housing option?</legend><input class="response-line" type="text" name="r14"></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="question"><legend>15. What questions would you want answered before deciding?</legend><input class="response-line" type="text" name="r15"></fieldset>

      <h3>About you <span class="note">(optional)</span></h3>
